    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 51 Answer: Escape the terrifying brown bear attack</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Scene confirmed: family by a wooden house with a garage, brown bear, deflated tyre, pump, balloon, paint, ninja outfit, motorcycle and mushrooms — all the listed props. Late moves were seen in order (garage opens at 1:05, mushroom/grandma at 1:10, 'Completed' at 1:20). Timestamps ±5 s.</div>
