      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 51 is \"Bear Attack\": Escape the terrifying brown bear attack. 14 moves in order, listed below and shown in the embedded walkthrough. Most moves are drags — if a tap does nothing, drag the object onto the person or prop it belongs to.</p>
    </div>
