    </a>

    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The pump leaves the yard for the balloon on the branch, the branch turns into a shovel two cards later, and the level ends with a mushroom rather than an engine, so watch where each prop is aimed.</p>
